---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="ka-closing" aria-labelledby="ka-cta-title">
	<div class="ka-shell">
		<div class="ka-cta" data-reveal>
			<div class="ka-noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
			<div class="ka-cta-content">
				<p class="ka-eyebrow">Start here</p>
				<h2 id="ka-cta-title" class="ka-section-title">下一次加速，从一次可验证的改动开始。</h2>
				<p class="ka-cta-desc">
					从导读出发，读完六章，做完全部练习；然后把 KDA 或 Humanize 的流程换成你自己的任务。先求写对，再求写快。
				</p>
				<div class="ka-cta-actions">
					<a class="ka-btn ka-btn-primary" href={`${base}guide/intro/`}>
						开始学习
						<svg
							viewBox="0 0 20 20"
							width="16"
							height="16"
							fill="none"
							stroke="currentColor"
							stroke-width="1.7"
							stroke-linecap="round"
							stroke-linejoin="round"
							aria-hidden="true"
						>
							<path d="M4 10h11"></path>
							<path d="m10.5 5.5 4.5 4.5-4.5 4.5"></path>
						</svg>
					</a>
					<a class="ka-btn ka-btn-secondary" href={`${base}exercises/`}>
						打开练习册
						<svg
							viewBox="0 0 20 20"
							width="16"
							height="16"
							fill="none"
							stroke="currentColor"
							stroke-width="1.6"
							stroke-linecap="round"
							stroke-linejoin="round"
							aria-hidden="true"
						>
							<path d="M6 3.5h9.5v13H6z"></path>
							<path d="M4 6.5h-.5v10H13"></path>
							<path d="M8.5 7.5h4.5M8.5 10.5h4.5M8.5 13.5h2.5"></path>
						</svg>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="ka-cta-links">
					<a href={`${base}glossary/`}>术语表 →</a>
					<a href={`${base}resources/`}>资料库 →</a>
					<a href={`${base}changelog/`}>更新日志 →</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<footer class="ka-footer">
			<p>
				非官方教材，内容基于公开资料。KDA、Humanize 与相关项目名称归各自所有者；上游仍在快速演进，请以官方文档与仓库为准。
			</p>
			<div class="ka-footer-meta">
				<span>资料核对 2026.10</span>
				<a href={`${base}resources/`}>资料来源</a>
				<a href="#ka-hero-title">回到顶部 ↑</a>
			</div>
		</footer>
	</div>
</section>
